---
description: API booking invariant and concurrency gate
globs: api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

- `api/src/__tests__/concurrency.test.ts`: additions only; never remove, skip, or weaken tests (see CLAUDE.md → THE CONCURRENCY GATE).
- Booking invariant: Postgres transaction + partial unique index; concurrent race → 201 and 409.
- Tests require `DATABASE_URL` (see `api/src/__tests__/helpers/postgres.ts`).
